<title>BELGIUM: FRANKI DUE TO PUBLISH RESULTS APRIL 22.</title>
<headline>FRANKI DUE TO PUBLISH RESULTS APRIL 22.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian construction group Franki NV will release 1996 results on April 22, a spokesman for the company told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
